q4os-welcome (4.4.0-a3) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Plasma: "Screen scaling" no longer leaves the Welcome window hidden for
    good. kcmshell keeps running after its window closed once the scale was
    changed, and the shared code waited for it to exit; it now waits 30 s at
    most, as the Qt frontend did before the split (QProcess default), and
    leaves kcmshell running on its own. The Trinity scaler is unchanged.

 -- Q4OS Team <devteam@q4os.org>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 19:30:00 +0200

